Package: strawwu-registry-hooks
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3,
         strawwu-desktop-actions
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU install pipeline hooks for app registry
 APT DPkg::Post-Invoke and Flatpak trigger scripts that scan Linux
 desktop entries and Flatpak apps into /var/lib/strawwu/app-registry.json.
